  "body": "Each library crate now ships a small headless CLI, shaped like `post` (a `USAGE` text, `--help`, `--version`, hand-rolled arguments, no new dependency). Bad input exits 1 with a `<bin>: <message>` line and never panics.\n\n| binary | does |\n|---|---|\n| `camcraft-geometry <model.stl>` | reads binary or ASCII STL and prints triangles, bounds, size, degenerate facets, open edges, closed |\n| `camcraft-cl <file.cl>` | reads a CL dump and prints move counts by kind, arcs, cycles, rapid and cut length, bounds, chaining (exits non-zero if the moves do not chain) |\n| `camcraft-tools list` / `speeds <work> <tool-mat> <D> <z>` | lists the built-in catalog with its sanity check; prints the rpm and feed window from the cutting table |\n| `camcraft-sim <file.cl> x0 y0 z0 x1 y1 z1 <D> [--ball] [--cell]` | cuts a stock box on the dexel grid and prints removed volume plus a rapid/depth verdict (exit 2 when flagged) |\n| `camcraft-motion face [-o f] x0 y0 x1 y1 <D> <stepover> <cut-z> <clear-z>` | runs the facing generator over a rectangle and writes a CL dump |\n\nNew module `cl::text`: a reader and writer for the golden CL dump grammar. Until now the writer lived only in app's test helpers and the reader only inside post, so cl, sim and motion could not reach either. Its output matches the golden writer byte for byte.\n\nLayering holds: no bin depends on app or ui. The sim change is limited to a new `src/bin` file and its test. The binaries are **not** added to the release zip (decision in `docs/decisions/32-headless-bins.md`).\n\n**Tests** (`tests/headless_bin.rs` in each crate, run through `CARGO_BIN_EXE_*`):\n- geometry: `geometry_bin_reads_a_closed_cube`, `geometry_bin_reads_ascii`, `geometry_bin_refuses_bad_input` (missing, garbage, truncated, NaN, unterminated facet, no args)\n- cl: `cl_text_round_trips_every_golden` (every `crates/app/tests/golden/*.cl` is read and written back byte for byte), `cl_bin_prints_move_stats`, `cl_bin_refuses_bad_input`\n- tools: `tools_bin_lists_a_sane_catalog`, `tools_bin_computes_speeds`, `tools_bin_refuses_bad_input`\n- sim: `sim_bin_removes_a_slot` (volume within 3% of analytic), `sim_bin_flags_a_rapid_through_stock`, `sim_bin_refuses_bad_input`\n- motion: `motion_bin_faces_a_rectangle` (output reads back as a chained path), `motion_bin_refuses_bad_input`\n\nAll 14 pass. Also green: `cargo clippy -p camcraft-{geometry,cl,tools,sim,motion} --bins --tests --lib -- -D warnings` and the cl lib unit tests.\n\nChangelog: Headless CLIs per crate: camcraft-geometry, camcraft-cl, camcraft-tools, camcraft-sim, camcraft-motion (dev tools, not in the release zip); cl gains a CL dump reader/writer (`cl::text`).\n\nFixes #32\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
